      "message": "[error] Line 71: 🔴 `findEnabledMedia` treats every nonzero-port m-line as enabled, including unsupported `application` (or other) sections. `getMediaAttributeListFromSdp` marks non-audio/video sections disabled and `processIncomingOffer` omits them, so an offer such as active audio, active application, active video makes the video answer resolve `remoteMedia` to the application m-line; payload preservation and RTCP-mux negotiation then use the wrong section. Filter to the same supported media types as the media-list construction, or retain the original remote m-line mapping.",
